    "detailed_description": "Challenge 3 difficulty levels of puzzles, and uncover the true ending of Puzzle's quest!<br><br>Boulder's, Ice, Patrols, and Spike traps oh my, along with many other types of fiendish traps await you!<br><br>Puzzle Sages is built on the concept of presenting fun, but difficult challenges. <br>The game's main features are as follows!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 30 Puzzle's of various difficulties and types!<br></li><li> No luck based challenges! if you beat a puzzle it's purely because of your skill as a player!<br></li><li> A fun story!<br></li><li> 100% hand crafted challenges and levels!<br></li><li> 3 varying difficulty levels with different endings, to push you too overcome the challenges to discover the truth!</li></ul>",
